[{"text": "Hello English learners and welcome back to another great lesson with EnglishPod.", "start": 2.3399999999999967, "end": 6.44}, {"text": "My name is Marco.", "start": 6.54, "end": 7.18}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 7.44, "end": 8.14}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you a great intermediate lesson with some really useful vocabulary.", "start": 8.56, "end": 13.14}, {"text": "Some vocabulary you can use to describe your job.", "start": 13.42, "end": 16.46}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 16.64, "end": 17.04}, {"text": "This is a really common situation when someone asks you what you do and you have to tell them.", "start": 17.24, "end": 23.08}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 23.3, "end": 23.62}, {"text": "So today's lesson is all about that.", "start": 23.82, "end": 25.6}, {"text": "So before we jump into our dialogue, let's start with our vocabulary preview.", "start": 25.6, "end": 30.68}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 31.64, "end": 32.9}, {"text": "We have two simple phrases today that you'll hear in our dialogue for our vocabulary preview.", "start": 33.16, "end": 38.28}, {"text": "The first one is VP.", "start": 38.8, "end": 41.26}, {"text": "VP.", "start": 41.76, "end": 42.28}, {"text": "VP.", "start": 42.76, "end": 43.0}, {"text": "So the VP of a company is?", "start": 43.68, "end": 46.02}, {"text": "The vice president.", "start": 46.24, "end": 47.08}, {"text": "The vice president.", "start": 47.46, "end": 48.52}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 48.74, "end": 49.06}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 49.42, "end": 49.52}, {"text": "Simple little acronym.", "start": 49.72, "end": 50.68}, {"text": "And the next word is Fortune 500 company.", "start": 51.0, "end": 54.82}, {"text": "Fortune 500 company.", "start": 54.82, "end": 57.22}, {"text": "Fortune 500 company.", "start": 57.38, "end": 59.02}, {"text": "So a Fortune 500 company is?", "start": 59.32, "end": 62.02}, {"text": "I'll let you explain.", "start": 62.56, "end": 63.74}, {"text": "Well, Fortune magazine ranks the 500 biggest companies in the U.S.", "start": 64.52, "end": 70.42}, {"text": "So a Fortune 500 company basically is?", "start": 70.56, "end": 73.28}, {"text": "One of the 500 biggest companies in the U.S.", "start": 73.46, "end": 75.88}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 76.04, "end": 76.3}, {"text": "That's simple.", "start": 76.3, "end": 76.9}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 77.18, "end": 77.32}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 77.6, "end": 77.84}, {"text": "Well, with those words, it sounds like we're going to be talking to some important people today.", "start": 77.92, "end": 82.76}, {"text": "Yes, we are going to be talking to some important people.", "start": 82.76, "end": 85.52}, {"text": "So let's listen to our dialogue for the first time.", "start": 85.8, "end": 89.04}, {"text": "Now, it's going to be a little bit fast, but you don't have to worry about it.", "start": 89.24, "end": 92.38}, {"text": "Because we'll come back and explain all of the important vocabulary.", "start": 92.48, "end": 95.66}, {"text": "Oh, look.", "start": 104.17999999999999, "end": 105.44}, {"text": "There's Caroline and a boyfriend.", "start": 105.82, "end": 107.52}, {"text": "She's always going on about him at the office.", "start": 107.98, "end": 110.6}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 112.52, "end": 113.28}, {"text": "They saw us.", "start": 113.52, "end": 114.44}, {"text": "They're coming this way.", "start": 114.78, "end": 116.0}, {"text": "Oh, man.", "start": 116.64, "end": 117.62}, {"text": "Jessica.", "start": 118.12, "end": 118.74}, {"text": "Arthur.", "start": 119.12, "end": 119.58}, {"text": "Hi.", "start": 119.92, "end": 120.38}, {"text": "I'd like you to meet my boyfriend, Greg.", "start": 121.16, "end": 123.44}, {"text": "He's the VP of Quality and Safety for a top Fortune 500 food company.", "start": 123.96, "end": 129.82}, {"text": "Nice to meet you.", "start": 130.16, "end": 131.36}, {"text": "This is my husband, Arthur.", "start": 132.12, "end": 133.68}, {"text": "Hey, how's it going?", "start": 134.36, "end": 135.44}, {"text": "Hello.", "start": 135.62, "end": 135.94}, {"text": "Caroline talks about you all the time.", "start": 136.86, "end": 138.96}, {"text": "I guess you must be pretty busy at work.", "start": 139.22, "end": 141.04}, {"text": "Well, yeah.", "start": 141.22, "end": 142.4}, {"text": "VP position is not easy, you know.", "start": 142.58, "end": 144.52}, {"text": "I implement policies and procedures nationwide in various departments, as well as train junior", "start": 145.62, "end": 151.1}, {"text": "managers in FDA and EPA regulations.", "start": 151.1, "end": 153.36}, {"text": "I also have to oversee daily operations of our quality control for the entire East Coast.", "start": 153.62, "end": 158.42}, {"text": "That alone means I have 1,500 employees under me.", "start": 158.66, "end": 161.9}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 162.92000000000002, "end": 163.52}, {"text": "Yeah, that sounds exciting.", "start": 163.94, "end": 166.02}, {"text": "And what about you, Arthur?", "start": 166.14, "end": 167.58}, {"text": "What do you do for a living?", "start": 167.58, "end": 168.6}, {"text": "Oh, I'm a top gun pilot.", "start": 169.24, "end": 172.44}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 186.60000000000002, "end": 187.64}, {"text": "Great music for our dialogue again, huh?", "start": 187.88, "end": 190.04}, {"text": "Chosen by?", "start": 190.22, "end": 191.24}, {"text": "By moi.", "start": 191.5, "end": 192.02}, {"text": "Of course.", "start": 192.38, "end": 192.8}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 193.74, "end": 193.88}, {"text": "Top Gun is one of my all-time favorite movies.", "start": 194.02, "end": 196.36}, {"text": "And Top Gun pilot.", "start": 196.58, "end": 197.72}, {"text": "What a cool profession.", "start": 197.88, "end": 198.72}, {"text": "An excellent profession.", "start": 198.94, "end": 199.94}, {"text": "Much cooler than being, like, the VP.", "start": 199.94, "end": 202.22}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 202.44, "end": 202.84}, {"text": "How boring is it?", "start": 203.16, "end": 203.62}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 203.62, "end": 203.8}, {"text": "Anyway, this guy was a bit of a jerk, don't you think?", "start": 204.0, "end": 206.02}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 206.18, "end": 206.38}, {"text": "You can tell a little bit of the sarcastic tone he had in his voice.", "start": 206.58, "end": 210.84}, {"text": "Definitely.", "start": 211.02, "end": 211.34}, {"text": "But he did use some interesting phrases, and we can talk about those now.", "start": 211.68, "end": 215.24}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 215.5, "end": 215.78}, {"text": "So let's take a look at language takeaway.", "start": 215.78, "end": 217.88}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 219.74, "end": 220.62}, {"text": "Our first word for language takeaways is implement.", "start": 221.72, "end": 225.06}, {"text": "Implement.", "start": 225.68, "end": 226.12}, {"text": "Implement.", "start": 226.54, "end": 226.98}, {"text": "Implement.", "start": 227.48, "end": 227.92}, {"text": "Let's listen to some examples of this word to help us understand its meaning.", "start": 227.92, "end": 233.28}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 234.08, "end": 235.24}, {"text": "Our company has to implement this sales strategy.", "start": 237.46, "end": 241.56}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 244.84, "end": 245.96}, {"text": "Sarah will be responsible for implementing the plan.", "start": 249.14, "end": 251.92}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 255.4, "end": 256.52}, {"text": "I implemented several new policies.", "start": 258.56, "end": 261.64}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 263.98, "end": 264.7}, {"text": "Great examples.", "start": 264.94, "end": 265.62}, {"text": "And just in case, to implement means to?", "start": 266.0, "end": 268.76}, {"text": "Put into action.", "start": 268.96, "end": 269.86}, {"text": "Put into action.", "start": 270.16, "end": 270.92}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 271.1, "end": 271.26}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 271.5, "end": 271.66}, {"text": "Our second word for language takeaway.", "start": 272.04, "end": 273.82}, {"text": "Policies.", "start": 274.52, "end": 275.24}, {"text": "Policies.", "start": 275.64, "end": 276.36}, {"text": "Policies.", "start": 276.78, "end": 277.5}, {"text": "Policies.", "start": 277.7, "end": 278.42}, {"text": "So, policies are basically rules and regulations.", "start": 278.42, "end": 282.62}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 282.94, "end": 283.28}, {"text": "Formal rules.", "start": 283.46, "end": 284.26}, {"text": "For a company or an organization.", "start": 284.58, "end": 286.46}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 286.66, "end": 287.0}, {"text": "Policies.", "start": 287.34, "end": 287.72}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 287.88, "end": 288.06}, {"text": "Third word?", "start": 288.42, "end": 289.0}, {"text": "Oversee.", "start": 289.84, "end": 290.44}, {"text": "Oversee.", "start": 291.3, "end": 291.9}, {"text": "Oversee.", "start": 292.98, "end": 293.58}, {"text": "Oversee.", "start": 294.1, "end": 294.7}, {"text": "So, when you oversee operations, it means?", "start": 294.9, "end": 298.74}, {"text": "Like, you watch it to make sure it's okay.", "start": 298.88, "end": 300.88}, {"text": "You supervise it.", "start": 301.14, "end": 302.0}, {"text": "This is an excellent word to use when you want to talk about your job responsibilities.", "start": 302.16, "end": 306.8}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 307.0, "end": 307.22}, {"text": "Oversee.", "start": 307.4, "end": 307.94}, {"text": "Oversee.", "start": 307.94, "end": 308.36}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 308.36, "end": 308.6}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 308.78, "end": 309.14}, {"text": "And our last word for language takeaway.", "start": 309.6, "end": 312.46}, {"text": "It's kind of tricky.", "start": 312.78, "end": 313.64}, {"text": "So, let's listen to how it was used in our dialogue.", "start": 313.64, "end": 317.86}, {"text": "That alone means I have 1,500 employees under me.", "start": 318.84000000000003, "end": 322.16}, {"text": "That alone means I have 1,500 employees under me.", "start": 324.76, "end": 328.08}, {"text": "So, this guy has 1,500 employees under him, meaning he supervises 1,500 employees.", "start": 330.34000000000003, "end": 336.78}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 336.94, "end": 337.04}, {"text": "He manages 1,500 employees.", "start": 337.12, "end": 338.76}, {"text": "He must be a busy man.", "start": 338.94, "end": 340.04}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 340.4, "end": 340.86}, {"text": "For 1,500 employees.", "start": 341.02, "end": 341.92}, {"text": "How many employees do you have under you, Erica?", "start": 342.0, "end": 344.74}, {"text": "Uh, two.", "start": 345.04, "end": 345.82}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 346.28, "end": 346.48}, {"text": "Not quite as much as 1,500.", "start": 346.48, "end": 347.9}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 348.36, "end": 348.52}, {"text": "I guess I'm not a VP right yet.", "start": 348.7, "end": 350.24}, {"text": "Right yet.", "start": 350.34, "end": 350.64}, {"text": "Hey?", "start": 350.72, "end": 350.82}, {"text": "Not yet.", "start": 351.12, "end": 351.66}, {"text": "But you will.", "start": 351.78, "end": 352.5}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 352.72, "end": 352.92}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 353.32, "end": 353.7}, {"text": "So, with this in mind, we are ready to listen to our dialogue for a second time.", "start": 353.7, "end": 357.78}, {"text": "And this time, it's going to be slower.", "start": 357.78, "end": 359.52}, {"text": "Oh, look.", "start": 362.74, "end": 364.1}, {"text": "There's Caroline and her boyfriend.", "start": 364.42, "end": 366.42}, {"text": "She's always going on about him at the office.", "start": 366.82, "end": 369.72}, {"text": "Oh, great.", "start": 370.3, "end": 371.64}, {"text": "They saw us.", "start": 371.64, "end": 372.8}, {"text": "They're coming this way.", "start": 373.04, "end": 374.72}, {"text": "Oh, man.", "start": 375.98, "end": 377.4}, {"text": "Jessica.", "start": 378.48, "end": 379.04}, {"text": "Arthur.", "start": 379.52, "end": 380.18}, {"text": "Hi.", "start": 380.66, "end": 381.2}, {"text": "I'd like you to meet my boyfriend, Greg.", "start": 381.9, "end": 384.52}, {"text": "He's the VP of Quality and Safety for a top Fortune 500 food company.", "start": 385.14, "end": 390.64}, {"text": "Nice to meet you.", "start": 391.6, "end": 392.98}, {"text": "This is my husband, Arthur.", "start": 393.62, "end": 395.42}, {"text": "Hey, how's it going?", "start": 395.98, "end": 396.92}, {"text": "Hello.", "start": 396.98, "end": 397.2}, {"text": "Caroline talks about you all the time.", "start": 398.38, "end": 400.94}, {"text": "I guess you must be pretty busy at work.", "start": 401.2, "end": 403.42}, {"text": "Well, yeah.", "start": 404.03999999999996, "end": 405.3}, {"text": "A VP position is not easy, you know.", "start": 405.74, "end": 408.12}, {"text": "I implement policies and procedures nationwide of various departments, as well as train junior", "start": 408.12, "end": 415.78}, {"text": "managers in FDA and EPA regulations.", "start": 415.78, "end": 419.36}, {"text": "I also have to oversee daily operations of our quality control for the entire East Coast.", "start": 420.08, "end": 426.14}, {"text": "That alone means I have 1,500 employees under me.", "start": 426.42, "end": 430.22}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 430.96, "end": 431.88}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 432.26, "end": 432.76}, {"text": "That sounds exciting.", "start": 433.32, "end": 435.24}, {"text": "And what about you, Arthur?", "start": 436.0, "end": 437.66}, {"text": "Arthur, what do you do for a living?", "start": 437.66, "end": 439.32}, {"text": "Oh, I'm a top gun pilot.", "start": 440.23999999999995, "end": 443.34}, {"text": "Okay, great stuff.", "start": 446.56, "end": 447.82}, {"text": "With this, now we can start with our fluency builder for today.", "start": 448.08, "end": 452.04}, {"text": "Fluency builder.", "start": 453.28, "end": 454.28}, {"text": "We heard some excellent phrases in this dialogue.", "start": 454.58, "end": 457.06}, {"text": "Some phrases that sound really natural, hey?", "start": 457.06, "end": 460.82}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 461.24, "end": 461.84}, {"text": "Especially the first one that we have today is whenever someone talks and talks and talks", "start": 462.12, "end": 467.64}, {"text": "and just, and continuously talks without stopping, you would say.", "start": 467.64, "end": 471.32}, {"text": "She's always going on about him at the office.", "start": 472.76, "end": 475.18}, {"text": "She's always going on about him at the office.", "start": 478.0, "end": 480.42}, {"text": "This is a really natural way of saying keeps talking about.", "start": 482.26, "end": 486.12}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 486.44, "end": 486.62}, {"text": "Keeps talking about him.", "start": 486.84, "end": 487.62}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 487.7, "end": 487.76}, {"text": "So we have a few examples of how this phrase works.", "start": 488.08, "end": 491.74}, {"text": "Let's listen.", "start": 492.08, "end": 492.96}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 493.78, "end": 494.76}, {"text": "My boss is always going on about how we need to save money.", "start": 497.3, "end": 501.88}, {"text": "It's all he talks about.", "start": 501.88, "end": 503.78}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 507.12, "end": 508.08}, {"text": "Gary is always going on about his kids.", "start": 511.24, "end": 513.9}, {"text": "He's always talking about how smart they are.", "start": 514.2, "end": 516.46}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 520.36, "end": 521.36}, {"text": "My mom is always going on about how I should get married.", "start": 524.04, "end": 528.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 531.28, "end": 531.8}, {"text": "Excellent.", "start": 531.82, "end": 532.18}, {"text": "It's clear now.", "start": 532.48, "end": 533.12}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 533.32, "end": 533.62}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 533.94, "end": 534.12}, {"text": "So let's move on to our second phrase for today.", "start": 534.14, "end": 536.56}, {"text": "And this is a great one to use whenever you meet someone for the first time.", "start": 536.6, "end": 540.52}, {"text": "Or when you start to talk to someone for the first time.", "start": 540.52, "end": 542.96}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 543.06, "end": 543.26}, {"text": "Hey, how's it going?", "start": 544.76, "end": 545.84}, {"text": "Hey, how's it going?", "start": 547.5, "end": 548.56}, {"text": "So this is a really relaxed and natural way of saying how are you?", "start": 549.44, "end": 555.16}, {"text": "How are you?", "start": 555.2, "end": 555.66}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 555.76, "end": 555.98}, {"text": "So yeah, you can just say, hey, how's it going?", "start": 556.32, "end": 558.34}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 558.54, "end": 558.72}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 559.06, "end": 559.2}, {"text": "Really natural sounding.", "start": 559.32, "end": 560.2}, {"text": "Now our third phrase is the most important one of our dialogue.", "start": 560.72, "end": 564.16}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 564.46, "end": 564.88}, {"text": "And it's a really common situation.", "start": 565.26, "end": 567.62}, {"text": "When someone asks you about your job, they might say this.", "start": 567.62, "end": 572.6}, {"text": "Arthur, what do you do for a living?", "start": 573.24, "end": 574.94}, {"text": "Arthur, what do you do for a living?", "start": 576.28, "end": 578.02}, {"text": "So this is a really great way of asking what work do you do or what is your job?", "start": 579.44, "end": 585.2}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 585.4, "end": 585.74}, {"text": "I know a lot of students sometimes say, what is your job?", "start": 586.02, "end": 590.16}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 590.4, "end": 590.72}, {"text": "And that is, it's kind of correct, but not really.", "start": 590.88, "end": 594.08}, {"text": "It doesn't sound very natural.", "start": 594.4, "end": 596.1}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 596.26, "end": 596.44}, {"text": "So you want to use what do you do or what do you do for a living?", "start": 596.44, "end": 600.66}, {"text": "Sounds great.", "start": 600.98, "end": 601.56}, {"text": "That's the way you ask someone what is their job.", "start": 601.96, "end": 603.86}, {"text": "And that's how you sound supernatural.", "start": 603.98, "end": 605.38}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 606.06, "end": 606.54}, {"text": "So we're ready now to listen to our dialogue a last time.", "start": 606.56, "end": 609.5}, {"text": "And now you are ready to understand everything.", "start": 609.68, "end": 613.04}, {"text": "Oh, look.", "start": 620.0400000000001, "end": 621.42}, {"text": "There's Caroline and a boyfriend.", "start": 621.7, "end": 623.42}, {"text": "She's always going on about him at the office.", "start": 623.86, "end": 626.5}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 628.34, "end": 629.14}, {"text": "They saw us.", "start": 629.42, "end": 630.34}, {"text": "They're coming this way.", "start": 630.86, "end": 631.9}, {"text": "Oh, man.", "start": 632.58, "end": 633.5}, {"text": "Jessica.", "start": 634.12, "end": 634.64}, {"text": "Arthur.", "start": 635.02, "end": 635.48}, {"text": "Hi.", "start": 635.84, "end": 636.28}, {"text": "I'd like you to meet my boyfriend, Greg.", "start": 636.94, "end": 639.34}, {"text": "He's the VP of Quality and Safety for a top Fortune 500 food company.", "start": 639.74, "end": 645.72}, {"text": "Nice to meet you.", "start": 646.04, "end": 647.26}, {"text": "This is my husband, Arthur.", "start": 647.9, "end": 649.58}, {"text": "Hey, how's it going?", "start": 650.22, "end": 651.34}, {"text": "Hello.", "start": 651.52, "end": 651.84}, {"text": "Caroline talks about you all the time.", "start": 652.72, "end": 654.88}, {"text": "I guess you must be pretty busy at work.", "start": 654.88, "end": 656.98}, {"text": "Well, yeah.", "start": 657.12, "end": 658.3}, {"text": "VP position is not easy, you know.", "start": 658.46, "end": 660.42}, {"text": "I implement policies and procedures nationwide in various departments, as well as train junior", "start": 661.5600000000001, "end": 667.0}, {"text": "managers in FDA and EPA regulations.", "start": 667.0, "end": 669.24}, {"text": "I also have to oversee daily operations of our quality control for the entire East Coast.", "start": 669.5, "end": 674.32}, {"text": "That alone means I have 1,500 employees under me.", "start": 674.32, "end": 677.82}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 678.84, "end": 679.4}, {"text": "Yeah, that sounds exciting.", "start": 679.86, "end": 681.92}, {"text": "And what about you, Arthur?", "start": 682.06, "end": 683.44}, {"text": "What do you do for a living?", "start": 683.44, "end": 684.48}, {"text": "Oh, I'm a top gun pilot.", "start": 685.56, "end": 688.34}, {"text": "Okay, so I have a little challenge for our listeners today.", "start": 703.44, "end": 706.94}, {"text": "What is it?", "start": 707.16, "end": 707.8}, {"text": "Two challenges, actually.", "start": 707.94, "end": 708.82}, {"text": "The first one, who performs the song that you heard and what is the song called?", "start": 709.28, "end": 715.2}, {"text": "Okay, I don't know the answer.", "start": 715.42, "end": 717.22}, {"text": "So I'm looking forward to seeing what users do.", "start": 717.22, "end": 720.0}, {"text": "And the second one is, what is the number one company in the Fortune 500?", "start": 720.28, "end": 725.64}, {"text": "Oh, I also don't know this answer.", "start": 726.02, "end": 728.0}, {"text": "Two great questions.", "start": 728.7, "end": 729.58}, {"text": "So I expect to see your answers on the comments page.", "start": 729.58, "end": 732.82}, {"text": "But also, we want to know about your profession.", "start": 732.94, "end": 735.5}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 735.78, "end": 736.02}, {"text": "Tell us about your job.", "start": 736.26, "end": 737.92}, {"text": "Tell us what you do.", "start": 737.92, "end": 739.22}, {"text": "And use some of the great phrases you learned today to describe your answer.", "start": 739.22, "end": 744.1}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 744.46, "end": 744.9}, {"text": "So we hope to see you there, but we're out of time now.", "start": 744.9, "end": 747.56}, {"text": "So we'll see everyone at EnglishPod.com.", "start": 747.9, "end": 751.18}, {"text": "Leave all your questions and, of course, all the comments.", "start": 751.28, "end": 753.7}, {"text": "And Marco and I are always around to answer your questions.", "start": 753.92, "end": 757.16}, {"text": "Well, until then, it's...", "start": 757.56, "end": 758.84}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 758.84, "end": 759.2}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 759.52, "end": 759.58}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 759.96, "end": 760.04}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 760.36, "end": 760.78}, {"text": "", "start": 761.68, "end": 761.68}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 761.86, "end": 762.26}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 762.62, "end": 763.04}, {"text": "", "start": 763.36, "end": 763.36}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 764.7, "end": 764.78}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 764.78, "end": 764.8}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 765.38, "end": 765.8}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.92}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 765.92, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "", "start": 765.98, "end": 765.98}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 766.12, "end": 766.54}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 768.28, "end": 768.44}]